  "hypothesis": "Replacing randomly locked Power-shard stats with kit-aware marginal sustainable-damage allocation and completed spawn healing increases matched wins and collected gems over ba646c6e. Unchanged or lower matched wins falsify it.",
  "bottleneck": "Farming survival and ineffective fixed random stats. Evidence establishes camp mortality and weak objective throughput, not the causal effect of stat choice.",
  "policy": "Keep random draft, Power family, routes and combat. Shop planner maximizes estimated effective health times sustained damage squared, with current SDK stats and used ability metadata. Simulate at most 64 affordable shards including Power combination bonuses; execute at most three bulk purchases. Wait on spawn while injured after shopping. Injured spawn occupants may use existing stationary champion combat before yielding, so healing does not require ignoring enemies.",
