  },
  "regression_risks": [
    "Survival utility can slow clears on safe cluster maps.",
    "Stationary sustained-damage model ignores movement cost, target contention and burst.",
    "AoE occupancy, shield realization and incoming attack rate are assumptions.",
    "New Health investments require time to heal; no new recall/field/dead shopping.",
    "Cassi/Issac linked death not modeled."
  ],
  "negative_findings": "Prior fixed roster/Strength, first Jungle emblem, economic recall/field/death shopping, spawn-heal-only, camp/PvP focus, reward deference, routing and broad disengagement do not establish this mixed-stat allocator. Do not reapply their full policies. Latest live-approach routing regressed development comparison and is omitted.",
